{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/121302-alt-first-age-idea-free-lilim-like-choice-for-young-dragonblooded","id":121302,"title":"Alt First Age idea: Free Lilim like choice, for young Dragonblooded?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Dragon-Blooded"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-04-28T16:59:58-07:00","id":121302,"title":"Alt First Age idea: Free Lilim like choice, for young Dragonblooded?","content":"The title will only make sense I know to those familiar with In Nomine.<br /> <br /> Any idea how it would have effected the First age?<br /> <br /> Allowing a dragon blooded at 16 or so a choice between freedom, but being responsible for himself, or being bound, and his Patron will pay his way to seocndary school, and equip him with artifacts in exchange for his pledge of loyalty.<br /> <br /> This would result in each Gentes Having members who were free, and who were bound to different Solars.<br /> <br /> Thus, hopefully, any overly dangerous actions, like a Coup against the deliberative or such would be more likely to be compromised.<br /> <br /> Just an idea.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-28T17:08:55-07:00","id":121307,"title":"","content":"...<br /> <br /> ...<br /> <br /> I hope I'm not coming across as an asshat here.<br /> <br /> If you want help with something/opinions on an idea, but it requires knowledge of an obscure thing, and you post your request to a forum, <i>explain the obscure thing for the people who don't know it</i>.<br /> <br /> Between the presumably obscure knowledge, odd word choices, and Seemingly Random capitalizations, I'm not at all sure of what you're asking.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-28T22:50:52-07:00","id":121510,"title":"","content":"Prince, i honestly think the division does not mean all that much or make much of a sense for a First Age game (or exalted games for that matter), as most first age DBs are in general bound to their <b>gentes</b>, <b>not</b> directly to a solar or lunar (origins of the gens and its loyalties notwithstanding), and can those count <b>as much as</b> a patron as any celestial exalt would. More so, considering they are <b>their families</b>.<br /> <br /> Not to mention serving specific celestial or gens is not - usually - a &quot;soul-shaping&quot;/power options-affecting decision as choosing a Demon Prince or to be a &quot;free&quot; lilim on In Nomine can be.<br /> Unless one uses Dynasty charms and expand on some specific &quot;minion buff&quot; celestial charms to <b>make it</b> so.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1147,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","user":"Baaldam","date":". 04-29-2014, 01:53 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}